# What `vercel deploy` must not upload. When this file exists Vercel uses it
# in place of .gitignore, so every local secret has to be named here too.

# Local environment files, whatever their suffix. The server's settings come
# from the Vercel project's environment, never from an uploaded file.
.env*

# Build output. The builder compiles from source.
target/

# Not needed to build the function.
.git/
.github/
docs/
trials/
compose.yaml
Makefile
